  "notes": "Godan verb (む row: {励|はげ}む → {励|はげ}まない → {励|はげ}んで). Takes the pattern ～⟦に→に：00314_ni⟧{励|はげ}む (to devote oneself to ~). The activity one works on is marked with ⟦に→に：00314_ni⟧.\n\nNot to be confused with the transitive form ⟦{励|はげ}ます→励ます：05304_hagemasu⟧ (to encourage someone).\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- ⟦{勉強|べんきょう}→勉強：00770_benkyou⟧⟦に→に：00314_ni⟧{励|はげ}む — to devote oneself to study\n- ⟦{仕事|しごと}→仕事：00480_shigoto⟧⟦に→に：00314_ni⟧{励|はげ}む — to work hard at one's job\n- ⟦{練習|れんしゅう}→練習：05323_renshuu⟧⟦に→に：00314_ni⟧{励|はげ}む — to work hard at practice\n- ⟦{研究|けんきゅう}→研究：01396_kenkyuu⟧⟦に→に：00314_ni⟧{励|はげ}む — to devote oneself to research",
